[
  {
    "_comment": "CAPABILITY suite for the MySQL connector, via `--type connectors/mysql.json`. Functions in functions/caps_mysql.py. SOURCE (`mysql_in`, reads existing mysql_world_xs seed): base, _inc (watermark, LIMIT 10 — re-run to walk), _none (WHERE 1=0), _multiquery (2 queries, transactional=False). DEST (`mysql_out`, input from dev datagen `caps_input/cap_rows`): _append (create then accumulate) and _replace (create then DROP+recreate) on distinct tables cap_append/cap_replace; re-run to observe. No schema evolution. Domains: dev (datagen), mysql_world_xs (source), mysql (dest). SRC METADATA: mysql_meta_keep and mysql_meta_drop (mysql_in) read the same one-query SELECT with and without the `tabsdata.src_metadata.drop` src_cfg key, and one transformer each in collection mysql_meta (group ops) asserts that side: mysql_meta_keep_check that the `@td.sql.query` and `@td.sql.initial_values` metadata columns are there plus exactly the expected data columns, mysql_meta_drop_check that no `@td.` column is left and the data columns are unchanged (functions/_srcmeta.py — which also explains why ONE transformer over both tables cannot work: an input reference puts the function in the producing plan, so it would run in each publisher's plan with the other's table missing)."
  },
  {
    "domain-manifest": {
      "domains": [
        {
          "name": "${xp:name(dev)}",
          "system": "dev"
        },
        {
          "name": "${xp:name(mysql_world_xs)}",
          "system": "mysql",
          "model": "world",
          "data": "xs"
        },
        {
          "name": "${xp:name(mysql)}",
          "system": "mysql"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "collections": [
      {
        "name": "caps_input",
        "type": "datagen_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/datagen_in.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(dev)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "mysql_in",
        "type": "mysql_sql_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/mysql_sql_in.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(mysql_world_xs)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "mysql_out",
        "type": "mysql_sql_out",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/mysql_sql_out.yaml",
        "group": "destinations",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(mysql)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "mysql_meta",
        "type": "transform",
        "group": "ops"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "functions": [
      {
        "collection": "caps_input",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_datagen.py::caps_rows"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_in"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_in_inc"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_in_none"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_in_multiquery"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_out_append"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_out_replace"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_out_none"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_meta_keep"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_meta_drop"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_meta",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_meta_keep_check"
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_meta",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_mysql.py::mysql_meta_drop_check"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "triggers": [
      {
        "collection": "caps_input",
        "function": "caps_rows",
        "detached": true
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "function": "mysql_in",
        "detached": true
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "function": "mysql_in_inc",
        "detached": true
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "function": "mysql_in_multiquery",
        "detached": true
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "function": "mysql_meta_keep",
        "detached": true
      },
      {
        "collection": "mysql_in",
        "function": "mysql_meta_drop",
        "detached": true
      }
    ]
  },
  {
